WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.096 --> 00:00:02.764
Most app revenue calculators multiply downloads

2
00:00:02.776 --> 00:00:05.950
by price That number is always wrong because

3
00:00:05.962 --> 00:00:08.245
subscribers cancel and the app store takes

4
00:00:08.257 --> 00:00:11.226
a cut first This one models both Start with

5
00:00:11.238 --> 00:00:13.353
your monthly downloads and the share of them

6
00:00:13.474 --> 00:00:16.623
that actually pay Set your price then set churn

7
00:00:16.995 --> 00:00:19.411
the share of subscribers who cancel each month

8
00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:22.440
Watch what happens the subscriber count climbs

9
00:00:22.596 --> 00:00:25.541
then flattens That ceiling is real If you add

10
00:00:25.553 --> 00:00:27.764
a hundred subscribers a month and lose five

11
00:00:27.776 --> 00:00:30.493
percent you stop at two thousand Halving churn

12
00:00:30.505 --> 00:00:33.293
doubles it Then the store takes its cut fifteen

13
00:00:33.305 --> 00:00:35.709
percent on your first million a year thirty

14
00:00:35.721 --> 00:00:38.702
above that You see gross the commission and

15
00:00:38.714 --> 00:00:41.935
what actually lands Switch to ads and the commission

16
00:00:41.947 --> 00:00:44.255
disappears because the stores do not take a

17
00:00:44.267 --> 00:00:46.851
share of what an ad network pays you Free

18
00:00:47.212 --> 00:00:49.519
instant runs entirely in your browser
